    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "human"
      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Iron Cordon Brigade packet sheet \u2014 Cordon Shock Trooper.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/iron-legion.json</code> (entry <code>cordon-shock-trooper</code>): Medium humanoid (human), Lawful Neutral; CR 2 (proficiency +2, to hit +5 with STR); AC 18 (Legion segmented plate & tower shield), hit points 45 (6d8+18), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the Iron Cordon Brigade article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>The backbone of the Iron Cordon. Shock Troopers advance in locked ranks with overlapping shields, absorbing spellfire and arrow volleys before stunning breach lines with synchronized shock batons.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> heavy frontliner \u00b7 <strong>tier:</strong> Patrol Infantry \u00b7 <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Frontline Patrol.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/iron-legion/cordon-shock-trooper.png</code> \u2014 NPC Forge render, seed 510004, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, cold iron and gunmetal grey armor, brass gears, glowing cyan star-bit conduits, flat colours, crisp shading. A heavily armored legionary soldier clad head-to-toe in bulky gunmetal plate armor with a narrow-slit enclosed iron helmet. Holding a massive rectangular tower shield stamped with the cog-and-shield Iron Legion crest and an electrified steel shock baton. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
